# A 2D fix (four satellites, HDOP 4: about 20 m): the dot and its accuracy ring, the chip: two orange bars.
title GPS: 2D fix, accuracy ring
sizes 640x480 480x320 320x480
env DECKATLAS_DEMO 1
env DECKATLAS_GPS auto
env DECKATLAS_GPS_FEED fix2d
env DECKATLAS_VIEW 48.889643,2.269995,16

wait 1500
shot fix-2d
expect text "Map"
